Package: niro-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nerufuyo <local@localhost>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46), dconf-cli, libgtk-4-1, libvulkan1, fontconfig, gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gnome-shell-extensions, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, gnome-shell-extension-ubuntu-tiling-assistant
Recommends: tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-ind
Replaces: neru-isle, neru-macos-dock, neru-digup-shell, neru-desktop-defaults
Conflicts: neru-isle, neru-macos-dock, neru-digup-shell, neru-desktop-defaults
Description: GNOME Shell extensions for Fedora 45 and Ubuntu 24.04 on Wayland
 A top-bar island, macOS-style dock, Spotlight-like app search, tiling window manager, window blur
 and rounded corners, with one control panel (org.niro.control: tone, opacity, blur).
